WEBVTT

00:00:25.301 --> 00:00:27.088
Stay on your knees.

00:00:27.088 --> 00:00:29.136
He's being held on suspicion of murder.

00:00:29.136 --> 00:00:30.019
Murder?

00:00:36.684 --> 00:00:39.716
And though a short exchange of weapons
fire occurred just a few minutes ago,

00:00:39.716 --> 00:00:45.447
Police and S.W.A.T.Teamsmaintain position as we
enter the third hour of this intense stand-Off.

00:00:45.447 --> 00:00:49.814
Authorities estimate as many as 10
hostages are being held inside the bank.

00:00:49.814 --> 00:00:52.715
No word as yet on the
identity of the suspects

00:00:54.753 --> 00:00:56.068
Something's happening.

00:00:56.961 --> 00:00:57.985
I think they're opening a door.

00:00:57.985 --> 00:00:59.230
Roger, you getting this?

00:01:02.783 --> 00:01:03.897
Over there.

00:01:05.835 --> 00:01:07.742
Turn the camera over there.

00:01:11.898 --> 00:01:12.781
No, no, no, no, no!

00:01:12.781 --> 00:01:13.694
Don't even think about it!

00:01:13.694 --> 00:01:14.929
Get the hell back!

00:01:31.522 --> 00:01:34.875
So, what's it like -Being an fbi guy?

00:01:35.919 --> 00:01:36.912
Well...

00:01:36.912 --> 00:01:38.448
It's dangerous.

00:01:39.201 --> 00:01:39.803
You know.

00:01:40.777 --> 00:01:44.320
And the secrets we got to
keep -Oh, countless secrets.

00:01:45.003 --> 00:01:47.583
But mostly it's -It's lonely.

00:01:48.647 --> 00:01:50.102
I so know what you mean.

00:01:50.725 --> 00:01:51.397
Yeah.

00:01:52.983 --> 00:01:54.499
Helena was our head buyer.

00:01:54.499 --> 00:01:57.621
She -She was family, you know?

00:01:58.574 --> 00:02:01.385
She said it herself every
year at the christmas party.

00:02:01.385 --> 00:02:03.262
She said we were the
only family she had.

00:02:03.262 --> 00:02:05.792
So there were never any signs
that she'd do something like this.

00:02:05.792 --> 00:02:06.605
No...

00:02:06.605 --> 00:02:08.673
Still can't believe it, even now.

00:02:08.673 --> 00:02:14.314
That night, helena came back to the store after
closing, cleaned out all the display cases and the safe.

00:02:14.655 --> 00:02:19.082
Edgar, our night watchman
-He caught her in the act.

00:02:19.082 --> 00:02:20.196
He didn't know what to do.

00:02:20.196 --> 00:02:21.823
He'd known her for years.

00:02:23.388 --> 00:02:24.633
He called me at home.

00:02:25.788 --> 00:02:27.394
And that's when she took his gun?

00:02:27.725 --> 00:02:29.732
She shot him in the face.

00:02:31.871 --> 00:02:35.002
I heard him die over the phone.

00:02:35.555 --> 00:02:37.462
Any idea what her
motive could have been?

00:02:37.462 --> 00:02:38.556
What motive?

00:02:38.556 --> 00:02:39.801
It makes no sense.

00:02:39.801 --> 00:02:44.679
Why steal all those diamonds, all that
jewelry and then, what, just dump it somewhere?

00:02:45.613 --> 00:02:48.253
Just hide it and then go home.

00:02:48.253 --> 00:02:49.969
She killed herself?

00:02:49.969 --> 00:02:53.774
The cop said she dropped the hair
dryer in the bath and fried herself.

00:02:53.774 --> 00:02:55.731
They should know, right?

00:02:56.554 --> 00:02:57.327
Yeah.

00:02:58.271 --> 00:03:00.459
Well, thanks, frannie.

00:03:00.459 --> 00:03:01.704
I think that's all I need.

00:03:01.704 --> 00:03:02.597
Really?

00:03:02.597 --> 00:03:09.021
I mean, 'cause i've got more, you
know, if you wanted to interview me...

00:03:09.021 --> 00:03:11.551
Sometime in private?

00:03:13.759 --> 00:03:14.412
Yeah.

00:03:15.024 --> 00:03:16.710
Yeah, I think that's a good idea.

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:18.216
You're a true patriot.

00:03:18.216 --> 00:03:18.839
You really are.

00:03:18.839 --> 00:03:20.575
Why don't you write your
number down there for me?

00:03:23.085 --> 00:03:26.126
So you never saw the security-Camera
footage yourself, then.

00:03:26.959 --> 00:03:29.258
The police -They took
all the tapes first thing.

00:03:29.258 --> 00:03:30.463
Of course they did.

00:03:36.214 --> 00:03:37.278
This is it.

00:03:38.603 --> 00:03:39.788
Freaking cops.

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:41.253
They were just doing their job.

00:03:41.253 --> 00:03:44.195
No, they're doing our job, only they
don't know it, so they suck at it.

00:03:45.108 --> 00:03:46.363
Talk to me about this bank.

00:03:47.748 --> 00:03:50.157
Milwaukee national trust -It
was hit about a month ago.

00:03:50.157 --> 00:03:51.412
Same M.O.As the jewelry store?

00:03:51.412 --> 00:03:55.417
Yep, inside job, longtime employee,
the "never in a million years" type.

00:03:55.417 --> 00:03:59.332
Dude robs the bank, then goes home
and supposedly commits suicide.

00:03:59.332 --> 00:04:01.048
Resnick was the security guard on duty?

00:04:01.048 --> 00:04:04.983
Yeah, he was actually beaten unconscious
by the teller who heisted the place.

00:04:04.983 --> 00:04:05.636
Oh, god.

00:04:05.636 --> 00:04:06.569
Yeah.

00:04:08.105 --> 00:04:09.320
Mr.Resnick!

00:04:09.932 --> 00:04:11.297
Ronald resnick.

00:04:23.072 --> 00:04:25.170
Fbi, mr.Resnick.

00:04:26.194 --> 00:04:27.368
Let me see the badge.

00:04:34.495 --> 00:04:36.101
I already gave my
statement to the police.

00:04:36.101 --> 00:04:40.719
Listen, ronald, just some things about your
statement we wanted to get some clarification on.

00:04:40.719 --> 00:04:42.064
You read it?

00:04:42.064 --> 00:04:43.028
Sure did.

00:04:43.028 --> 00:04:44.312
Come to listen to what I got to say?

00:04:44.312 --> 00:04:45.557
That's why we're here.

00:04:48.378 --> 00:04:49.091
Well...

00:04:50.536 --> 00:04:51.329
Come on in.

00:04:55.043 --> 00:04:59.179
See, none of the cops ever called me back,
not after I told them what was really going on.

00:05:00.012 --> 00:05:01.618
They all thought I was crazy.

00:05:02.391 --> 00:05:05.714
First off, juan morales never
robbed the milwaukee national trust.

00:05:05.714 --> 00:05:07.229
That I guarantee.

00:05:07.229 --> 00:05:08.594
See, me and juan were friends.

00:05:08.594 --> 00:05:12.268
He used to come back to the bank on
my night shifts, and we'd play cards.

00:05:14.125 --> 00:05:17.599
So you let him into the
bank that night, after hours.

00:05:17.599 --> 00:05:19.245
The thing I let into the bank...

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:21.784
Wasn't juan.

00:05:22.527 --> 00:05:26.030
I mean, it had his face,
but it wasn't his face.

00:05:26.030 --> 00:05:30.016
Every detail was perfect, but too perfect,
you know, like if a doll maker made it,

00:05:30.016 --> 00:05:32.565
Like I was talking to a big juan doll.

00:05:32.565 --> 00:05:34.081
A juan doll?

00:05:34.081 --> 00:05:36.611
Look, this wasn't the
only time this happened.

00:05:36.611 --> 00:05:42.372
There was this jewelry store, too, and the
cops and you guys, you just won't see it.

00:05:43.135 --> 00:05:45.484
Both crimes were pulled
by the same thing.

00:05:45.946 --> 00:05:47.612
And what's that, mr.Resnick?

00:05:50.704 --> 00:05:53.876
Chinese been working on them for
years, and the russians before that

00:05:53.876 --> 00:06:00.923
Part man, part machine, like the terminator, but the kind
that can change itself, make itself look like other people.

00:06:00.923 --> 00:06:01.836
Like the one from "t2."

00:06:01.836 --> 00:06:02.629
Exactly!

00:06:02.629 --> 00:06:07.247
So not just a robot,
more of a -A man-Droid.

00:06:07.247 --> 00:06:08.863
A man-Droid?

00:06:09.314 --> 00:06:11.834
What makes you so sure
about this, ronald?

00:06:18.017 --> 00:06:20.045
I made copies of all the security tapes.

00:06:20.045 --> 00:06:21.993
I knew once the cops got
them, they'd be buried.

00:06:21.993 --> 00:06:22.986
Here.

00:06:24.582 --> 00:06:25.456
Now watch.

00:06:27.825 --> 00:06:28.798
WatcH.

00:06:30.023 --> 00:06:30.615
Watch him.

00:06:30.615 --> 00:06:31.428
Watch.Watch.

00:06:32.733 --> 00:06:34.369
See, look, there it is!

00:06:36.176 --> 00:06:36.558
You see?

00:06:36.558 --> 00:06:38.073
He's got the laser eyes.

00:06:45.732 --> 00:06:51.153
Cops said it was some kind of reflected
light, some kind of "camera flare."

00:06:51.585 --> 00:06:52.197
Okay?

00:06:52.468 --> 00:06:54.044
Ain't no damn camera flare.

00:06:54.546 --> 00:06:56.262
They say I'm a post-Trauma case.

00:06:56.262 --> 00:06:57.226
So what?

00:06:57.527 --> 00:06:58.621
Bank goes and fires me.

00:06:58.621 --> 00:06:59.555
It don't matter.

00:06:59.555 --> 00:07:02.115
The man-Droid is still out there.

00:07:04.765 --> 00:07:08.790
If the law won't hunt this
thing down, I'll do it myself.

00:07:09.412 --> 00:07:13.217
You see, this thing, I-It kills the real
person, makes it look like a suicide,

00:07:13.217 --> 00:07:18.627
Then it sort of like morphs into that person, cases
the job for a while till it knows the take is fat,

00:07:18.627 --> 00:07:20.434
And then it finds its opening.

00:07:20.846 --> 00:07:23.275
Now, these robberies,
they're grouped together,

00:07:23.275 --> 00:07:28.143
So I figure the man-Droid is holed up somewhere
in the middle -Underground maybe -I don't know.

00:07:28.143 --> 00:07:33.694
M-Maybe that's where it recharges
its m-Man-Droid batteries.

00:07:33.694 --> 00:07:34.718
Okay.

00:07:36.706 --> 00:07:38.332
I want you to listen very carefully.

00:07:39.607 --> 00:07:43.130
'Cause I'm about to tell you the
god's honest truth about all of this.

00:07:46.884 --> 00:07:48.320
There's no such thing as man-Droids.

00:07:50.779 --> 00:07:52.987
There's nothing evil or
inhuman going on out there.

00:07:52.987 --> 00:07:53.961
It's just people.

00:07:54.212 --> 00:07:54.724
Nothing else.

00:07:54.724 --> 00:07:55.637
You understand?

00:08:00.054 --> 00:08:02.403
The laser eyes just a
camera flare, mr.Resnick.

00:08:02.403 --> 00:08:06.348
I know you don't want to believe this, but
your friend juan robbed the bank, and that's it.

00:08:08.576 --> 00:08:09.841
Get out of my house!

00:08:11.006 --> 00:08:11.839
Now!

00:08:12.120 --> 00:08:12.893
Sure.

00:08:13.455 --> 00:08:14.308
First things first.

00:08:17.992 --> 00:08:20.391
Man, that has got to be
the kicker, straight up.

00:08:21.084 --> 00:08:26.273
When you told that poor son of a bitch to -What
did you say, "remand" the tapes that he copied?

00:08:26.575 --> 00:08:29.195
"Classified evidence of
an ongoing investigation"?

00:08:29.195 --> 00:08:30.429
That's messed up.

00:08:31.513 --> 00:08:33.190
What are you, pissed at me?

00:08:33.190 --> 00:08:36.221
No, I just think it's a little
creepy how good of a fed you are.

00:08:36.221 --> 00:08:38.369
We could have thrown the guy a bone.

00:08:38.369 --> 00:08:39.845
He did some good legwork here.

00:08:40.738 --> 00:08:41.842
"Man-Droid"?

00:08:41.842 --> 00:08:43.850
Except for the man-Droid part.

00:08:44.503 --> 00:08:45.285
I liked him.

00:08:45.366 --> 00:08:46.701
He's not that different from you and me.

00:08:46.701 --> 00:08:47.524
People think we're crazy.

00:08:47.524 --> 00:08:48.759
Except he's not a hunter.

00:08:49.401 --> 00:08:51.439
He's just a guy who
stumbled onto something real.

00:08:51.439 --> 00:08:53.978
If he were to go up against
this thing, he'd get torn apart.

00:08:53.978 --> 00:08:56.749
Better to stay in the
dark and stay alive.

00:08:56.749 --> 00:08:57.793
Yeah, I guess.

00:09:00.794 --> 00:09:01.708
Shapeshifter.

00:09:03.264 --> 00:09:04.930
Just like back in st.Louis.

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:06.747
Same retinal reaction to video.

00:09:07.490 --> 00:09:08.664
Eyes flare at the camera.

00:09:09.638 --> 00:09:10.762
I hate those freaking things.

00:09:11.304 --> 00:09:12.127
You think I don't?

00:09:12.860 --> 00:09:15.309
One didn't turn into you
and frame you for murder.

00:09:17.779 --> 00:09:21.714
Well, look, if this shifter's anything like the
one we killed in missouri then ronald's right.

00:09:25.066 --> 00:09:28.098
All right, they like to lair up
underground, preferably the sewer.

00:09:28.098 --> 00:09:31.039
All the robberies have been
connected so far, right?

00:09:31.039 --> 00:09:33.799
Through the, uh, sewer main layout.

00:09:37.704 --> 00:09:40.003
There's one more bank lined
up on that same sewer main.

00:09:48.876 --> 00:09:51.777
Well, we haven't had any
flags go up on our system yet.

00:09:51.777 --> 00:09:53.976
No, no, this is a glitch
in the overall grid.

00:09:53.976 --> 00:09:56.184
Just want to make sure the
branch monitors are kosher.

00:09:56.184 --> 00:09:58.011
Better to be safe than sorry, I guess.

00:09:58.011 --> 00:09:58.824
That's the plan.

00:10:02.789 --> 00:10:03.713
All righty.

00:10:04.335 --> 00:10:05.389
You guys need anything else?

00:10:05.389 --> 00:10:06.052
Oh, no, no, no.

00:10:06.052 --> 00:10:07.547
We'll be in and out.

00:10:07.547 --> 00:10:08.641
Just a routine check.

00:10:08.641 --> 00:10:09.756
Okeydokey.

00:10:12.907 --> 00:10:13.580
I like him.

00:10:13.680 --> 00:10:14.795
He says "okeydokey."

00:10:14.795 --> 00:10:15.929
What if he's the shifter?

00:10:15.929 --> 00:10:20.426
Well, then we follow him home, put a
silver bullet through his chest plate.

00:10:25.616 --> 00:10:26.650
Okay.

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:28.175
You got any popcorn?

00:10:38.685 --> 00:10:41.175
Looks like mr.Okeydokey'S...

00:10:41.606 --> 00:10:42.660
Okeydokey.

00:10:44.387 --> 00:10:46.304
Maybe we jumped the gun on this, dean.

00:10:47.990 --> 00:10:49.476
We don't even know it's here.

00:10:50.430 --> 00:10:52.578
Maybe we should just
go to the sewers and...

00:10:53.280 --> 00:10:54.415
And...

00:10:54.415 --> 00:10:55.860
And...

00:10:59.313 --> 00:11:01.180
Dean, we're supposed
to be looking for eyes.

00:11:02.194 --> 00:11:03.419
I'm getting there.

00:11:04.212 --> 00:11:04.884
Oh, yeah?

00:11:05.095 --> 00:11:05.918
Yeah.

00:11:08.227 --> 00:11:09.361
Wait a minute.

00:11:12.553 --> 00:11:13.467
Hello, freak.

00:11:13.467 --> 00:11:14.471
Got him.

00:11:16.810 --> 00:11:17.472
Sam.

00:11:19.038 --> 00:11:19.841
What?

00:11:24.639 --> 00:11:26.025
Hello, ronald.

00:11:39.295 --> 00:11:40.911
This is not a robbery!

00:11:43.912 --> 00:11:46.592
Everybody on the floor now!

00:11:50.658 --> 00:11:51.712
Get down, damn it!

00:11:52.334 --> 00:11:52.937
Come on!

00:11:53.559 --> 00:11:54.492
On the floor, on the floor.

00:11:54.492 --> 00:11:55.948
In the middle!

00:11:56.390 --> 00:11:57.775
On the floor in the middle.

00:11:57.775 --> 00:11:59.722
In middle, on the floor, come on!

00:11:59.913 --> 00:12:00.435
Hurry up!

00:12:00.435 --> 00:12:01.338
Come on!

00:12:01.830 --> 00:12:03.858
And you said we shouldn't bring guns.

00:12:06.277 --> 00:12:07.552
I didn't know this
was gonna happen, dean.

00:12:07.552 --> 00:12:08.435
Let me do the talking.

00:12:08.435 --> 00:12:10.252
I don't think he likes
you, agent johnson.

00:12:10.834 --> 00:12:17.369
There's only one way in or out of here, and I
chained it up, so nobody's leaving, you understand?

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:18.413
Hey, buddy.

00:12:19.668 --> 00:12:20.511
Why don't you calm down?

00:12:20.511 --> 00:12:21.675
Just calm down.

00:12:22.348 --> 00:12:23.161
What?

00:12:24.245 --> 00:12:25.259
You!

00:12:26.333 --> 00:12:27.819
Get on the floor now!

00:12:27.819 --> 00:12:28.863
Okay, we're doing that.

00:12:29.455 --> 00:12:31.111
Just don't shoot anybody, especially us.

00:12:31.111 --> 00:12:33.008
I knew it -As soon as you two left.

00:12:33.008 --> 00:12:34.062
You ain't fbi.

00:12:34.062 --> 00:12:35.146
Who are you?

00:12:35.919 --> 00:12:37.455
Who are you working for, huh?

00:12:37.455 --> 00:12:38.620
The men in black?

00:12:40.085 --> 00:12:41.240
You working for the man-Droid?

00:12:41.240 --> 00:12:42.384
We're not!

00:12:42.384 --> 00:12:43.869
You shut up!

00:12:43.869 --> 00:12:44.923
I ain't talking to you!

00:12:44.923 --> 00:12:46.319
I don't like you!

00:12:47.945 --> 00:12:48.617
Fair enough.

00:12:52.522 --> 00:12:53.707
Get over there.

00:12:53.978 --> 00:12:55.544
Frisk them down, make
sure they got no weapons.

00:12:55.544 --> 00:12:56.477
Go!

00:13:12.548 --> 00:13:13.893
And what have we here?

00:13:13.893 --> 00:13:15.590
I'm not just gonna walk in here naked.

00:13:17.939 --> 00:13:19.003
Give that there.

00:13:20.639 --> 00:13:21.693
No, no, no, no.

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:27.495
We know you don't want to hurt anybody.

00:13:27.615 --> 00:13:29.553
But that's what's gonna happen
if you keep waving that cannon.

00:13:29.553 --> 00:13:30.878
Why don't you let these people go?

00:13:30.878 --> 00:13:31.731
No!

00:13:31.731 --> 00:13:32.875
I already told you.

00:13:32.875 --> 00:13:35.917
If nobody's gonna stop this thing,
then I've got to do it myself!

00:13:35.917 --> 00:13:37.192
We believe you!

00:13:37.192 --> 00:13:37.975
That's why we're here.

00:13:37.975 --> 00:13:39.229
You don't believe me!

00:13:40.223 --> 00:13:41.669
Nobody believes me!

00:13:42.803 --> 00:13:43.877
How could they?

00:13:47.059 --> 00:13:47.501
Come here.

00:13:48.986 --> 00:13:49.759
What?

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:50.853
No.

00:13:50.853 --> 00:13:51.817
You're holding the gun, boss.

00:13:51.817 --> 00:13:52.570
You're calling the shots.

00:13:52.570 --> 00:13:54.959
I just want to tell
you something.Come here.

00:14:02.999 --> 00:14:04.274
It's the bank manager.

00:14:05.368 --> 00:14:05.870
What?

00:14:07.185 --> 00:14:09.173
Why do you think we
got these getups, huh?

00:14:09.624 --> 00:14:11.301
We've been monitoring
the cameras in the back.

00:14:11.301 --> 00:14:12.817
We saw the bank manager.

00:14:12.817 --> 00:14:14.232
We saw his eyes.

00:14:15.477 --> 00:14:16.360
His laser eyes?

00:14:16.360 --> 00:14:17.123
Yes.

00:14:17.123 --> 00:14:17.575
No.

00:14:17.575 --> 00:14:17.936
No!

00:14:17.936 --> 00:14:18.970
We're running out of time.

00:14:18.970 --> 00:14:20.947
We got to find him before
he changes into someone else.

00:14:20.947 --> 00:14:21.931
Like I'm gonna listen to you.

00:14:21.931 --> 00:14:23.557
You're a damn liar.

00:14:25.505 --> 00:14:26.288
I'll shoot you!

00:14:26.288 --> 00:14:27.332
Get down!

00:14:28.536 --> 00:14:29.409
Take me.

00:14:30.162 --> 00:14:31.949
Take me as a hostage.

00:14:31.949 --> 00:14:36.225
But we got to act fast because the longer we
just sit here, the more time he has to change.

00:14:36.777 --> 00:14:37.721
Look at me, man.

00:14:38.685 --> 00:14:39.518
I believe you.

00:14:40.572 --> 00:14:41.565
You're not crazy.

00:14:43.111 --> 00:14:45.179
There really is something
inside this bank.

00:14:51.754 --> 00:14:52.397
All right.

00:14:54.866 --> 00:14:56.633
Y-You come with me.

00:14:58.751 --> 00:15:00.618
But everyone else gets in the vault!

00:15:17.190 --> 00:15:17.923
Come on, move!

00:15:19.861 --> 00:15:20.784
Move, move!

00:15:21.788 --> 00:15:23.053
Then you lock it up.

00:15:31.284 --> 00:15:32.137
It's okay, everyone.

00:15:32.137 --> 00:15:33.000
Just stay cool.

00:15:37.437 --> 00:15:37.929
Now spin that.

00:15:37.929 --> 00:15:38.792
Spin that there.

00:15:41.613 --> 00:15:42.888
Who is that man?

00:15:46.070 --> 00:15:47.084
He's my brother.

00:15:48.680 --> 00:15:51.500
He is so brave.

00:15:58.136 --> 00:15:59.129
Check behind the desk.

00:16:17.760 --> 00:16:19.246
What the hell is that?

00:16:26.252 --> 00:16:27.336
Oh, great.

00:16:28.711 --> 00:16:30.749
When it changes form,
it sheds its old skin.

00:16:30.749 --> 00:16:32.195
So now it could be anybody.

00:16:34.584 --> 00:16:35.166
So...

00:16:37.043 --> 00:16:37.846
So weird.

00:16:38.920 --> 00:16:41.118
Its robot skin is so lifelike.

00:16:41.128 --> 00:16:42.162
Okay, let's get something straight.

00:16:42.162 --> 00:16:43.508
It's not a man-Droid.

00:16:43.508 --> 00:16:44.993
It's a shapeshifter.

00:16:44.993 --> 00:16:45.605
Shapeshifter?

00:16:45.605 --> 00:16:46.469
Yeah.

00:16:46.469 --> 00:16:48.416
It's human, more or less.

00:16:49.038 --> 00:16:49.852
It has human drive.

00:16:49.852 --> 00:16:51.227
And in this case, it's money.

00:16:51.227 --> 00:16:52.522
But it generates its own skin.

00:16:52.522 --> 00:16:55.152
It can shape it to match
someone else's features

00:16:55.884 --> 00:16:58.605
So I-It kills someone and
then takes their place.

00:16:58.605 --> 00:17:00.341
Kills them -I don't think it matters.

00:17:00.341 --> 00:17:01.345
What are you doing?

00:17:06.284 --> 00:17:06.946
Nice.

00:17:08.342 --> 00:17:09.978
You remember the old werewolf stories?

00:17:09.978 --> 00:17:11.273
Pretty much came from these guys.

00:17:11.825 --> 00:17:13.622
Silver's the only thing
I've seen that hurts them.

00:17:15.539 --> 00:17:16.523
Come on, ronald.

00:18:24.550 --> 00:18:25.173
How we doing?

00:18:25.594 --> 00:18:26.859
Another day in paradise.

00:18:27.311 --> 00:18:28.305
No one's come out yet?

00:18:28.305 --> 00:18:29.951
This guy locked himself in.

00:18:31.928 --> 00:18:33.022
First thing he did.

00:18:36.365 --> 00:18:36.917
All right.

00:18:37.871 --> 00:18:39.216
Cut the power.

00:18:40.862 --> 00:18:41.856
What are you, nuts?

00:18:41.856 --> 00:18:43.040
That's just it.

00:18:44.265 --> 00:18:45.419
I'm not nuts.

00:18:46.544 --> 00:18:50.378
I mean, I was so scared that I was
losing my marbles, but this is real.

00:18:51.021 --> 00:18:52.597
I mean, I-I was right.

00:18:53.279 --> 00:18:55.186
Except for the man-Droid thing.

00:18:55.186 --> 00:18:55.969
Thank you.

00:18:56.843 --> 00:18:57.836
Yeah, don't mention it.

00:19:05.465 --> 00:19:06.088
Damn it.

00:19:06.610 --> 00:19:08.407
No, no, no, no, no, no.

00:19:08.407 --> 00:19:09.410
What is it?

00:19:09.410 --> 00:19:10.103
They cut the power.

00:19:10.103 --> 00:19:11.558
It's probably their way of saying hi.

00:19:11.558 --> 00:19:12.412
Who?

00:19:12.412 --> 00:19:13.416
Cops.

00:19:13.416 --> 00:19:14.520
The cops?

00:19:15.303 --> 00:19:17.300
You weren't exactly a smooth
criminal about this, ron.

00:19:17.300 --> 00:19:19.418
You didn't even secure
the security guard.

00:19:19.418 --> 00:19:20.402
He probably called them.

00:19:20.402 --> 00:19:22.239
Well, I didn't think to hang on.

00:19:22.239 --> 00:19:23.233
Let's just take a breath for a second.

00:19:25.280 --> 00:19:26.616
They probably got us surrounded.

00:19:27.649 --> 00:19:30.781
They cut the power to the cameras, so there's
no way of telling who the shapeshifter is.

00:19:32.578 --> 00:19:33.933
It's not looking good, ron.

00:19:39.354 --> 00:19:40.117
Did you hear that?

00:19:41.392 --> 00:19:43.158
Has your brother always been so...

00:19:43.981 --> 00:19:45.096
Wonderful?

00:19:45.096 --> 00:19:48.438
I mean, staring down that gun.

00:19:49.161 --> 00:19:54.039
And the way he played right into that psycho's
crazy head, telling him what he wanted to hear?

00:19:54.039 --> 00:19:59.109
Hero or something.

00:19:59.109 --> 00:20:00.123
Yeah.

00:20:00.644 --> 00:20:01.437
Yeah.

00:20:03.716 --> 00:20:05.312
Oh, my g-You saved us!

00:20:05.312 --> 00:20:06.677
You saved us!

00:20:06.677 --> 00:20:08.273
Actually I just found a few more.

00:20:09.869 --> 00:20:10.532
Come on, everybody, let's go.

00:20:10.532 --> 00:20:11.405
Let's go.

00:20:19.958 --> 00:20:21.273
What are you doing?

00:20:21.273 --> 00:20:23.692
Sam, look, ronald and
i need to talk to you.

00:20:36.410 --> 00:20:37.635
It shed its skin again.

00:20:37.635 --> 00:20:38.588
We don't know when.

00:20:38.588 --> 00:20:40.204
Could be in the halls, the vault.

00:20:41.489 --> 00:20:42.383
Great.

00:20:43.256 --> 00:20:45.143
You know, dean, you are
wanted by the police.

00:20:45.143 --> 00:20:46.057
Yeah.

00:20:46.057 --> 00:20:49.469
So even if we do find this damn thing,
how the hell are we gonna get out of here?

00:20:49.469 --> 00:20:51.066
One problem at a time.

00:20:51.889 --> 00:20:54.438
I'm gonna do a sweep of the whole
place, see if I can find any stragglers.

00:20:54.438 --> 00:20:57.219
Once we get everyone together,
we got to play "find the freak."

00:20:57.219 --> 00:20:58.353
So here.

00:20:58.353 --> 00:20:59.879
I found another one of these for you.

00:20:59.879 --> 00:21:00.903
Now, stay here.

00:21:00.903 --> 00:21:02.609
Make sure ronald doesn't hurt anybody.

00:21:02.780 --> 00:21:05.129
Help him manage the help him manage?

00:21:05.681 --> 00:21:06.865
Are you insane?

00:21:11.553 --> 00:21:12.958
Look, I know this isn't
going the way we wanted.

00:21:12.958 --> 00:21:13.792
Understatement.

00:21:13.792 --> 00:21:18.821
But if we invite the cops in right now, ronald gets
arrested, we get arrested, the shifter gets away.

00:21:18.821 --> 00:21:23.659
Probably never find
it again, okay -Ron!

00:21:24.412 --> 00:21:25.647
Out of the light!

00:21:30.435 --> 00:21:31.288
Seriously?

00:21:31.358 --> 00:21:32.713
Ron's plan was a bad plan.

00:21:32.713 --> 00:21:36.558
It was a bit of a crazy plan, but right
now, crazy's the only game in town, okay?

00:21:50.541 --> 00:21:51.655
Hi, ronald.

00:22:51.743 --> 00:22:54.784
I'm gonna keep this open, get you folks
some fresh air in there, all right?

00:22:55.878 --> 00:22:57.434
But no one leaves this vault.

00:23:00.908 --> 00:23:01.550
I don't understand.

00:23:01.550 --> 00:23:03.096
Why are you helping him?

00:23:03.357 --> 00:23:05.023
You wouldn't believe me if I told you.

00:23:07.081 --> 00:23:07.954
H-Hello?

00:23:07.954 --> 00:23:09.279
I think I got to get out of here.

00:23:09.279 --> 00:23:11.447
Sir, I'm very sorry, but you're
just gonna have to stay put.

00:23:11.447 --> 00:23:14.619
What do you mean, demands?

00:23:14.619 --> 00:23:15.653
Ronald...

00:23:15.653 --> 00:23:16.426
Hang up.

00:23:16.426 --> 00:23:17.972
I-I'm not a bank robber.

00:23:17.972 --> 00:23:19.638
I got to really get out of here.

00:23:19.638 --> 00:23:20.632
Sir, you can't leave.

00:23:20.632 --> 00:23:22.690
Kind of a crime fighter, I guess.

00:23:22.690 --> 00:23:23.824
Ronald!

00:23:27.769 --> 00:23:28.131
Look...

00:23:28.131 --> 00:23:29.787
No, I'm acting alone.

00:23:31.624 --> 00:23:32.367
Ronald...

00:23:33.381 --> 00:23:34.655
The less the cops know, the better.

00:23:34.655 --> 00:23:36.533
I think this dude's
having a heart attack!

00:23:37.215 --> 00:23:37.938
Great.

00:23:38.108 --> 00:23:39.604
Could be our guy, could be a trick.

00:23:39.604 --> 00:23:40.769
Are you just gonna let the man die?

00:23:40.769 --> 00:23:42.104
No one's dying in here!

00:23:42.505 --> 00:23:43.358
Cover the door.

00:23:50.867 --> 00:23:52.854
Can you tell me how many
hostages this guy's taken?

00:23:52.854 --> 00:23:55.063
One of the people in here
could be having heart trouble.

00:23:55.063 --> 00:23:56.438
You need to send in a paramedic.

00:23:56.438 --> 00:23:58.024
Just stay calm, sir.

00:23:58.024 --> 00:23:59.710
Just send in a paramedic, okay?!

00:23:59.710 --> 00:24:01.136
Don't try anything else!

00:24:01.136 --> 00:24:02.431
Please.

00:24:02.471 --> 00:24:03.304
Paramedic?

00:24:03.304 --> 00:24:04.579
Guy don't have time for that, man.

00:24:04.579 --> 00:24:06.918
Listen, I-I'm sorry, okay?

00:24:06.918 --> 00:24:08.022
But nobody's getting out.

00:24:08.022 --> 00:24:09.407
He's dying right in front of you.

00:24:10.642 --> 00:24:11.475
Help.

00:24:50.533 --> 00:24:51.025
Come on, man.

00:24:51.025 --> 00:24:52.370
You got to unlock the front door.

00:24:53.103 --> 00:24:54.197
We got to get him out of here.

00:24:54.909 --> 00:24:56.817
Both of you stay where you are!

00:25:03.994 --> 00:25:04.927
You know what, ronald?

00:25:05.730 --> 00:25:06.423
He's right.

00:25:06.714 --> 00:25:08.099
We got to get this man outside.

00:25:08.099 --> 00:25:08.621
Come on.

00:25:08.621 --> 00:25:09.455
I got you.

00:25:10.107 --> 00:25:11.071
I'll help you.

00:25:11.071 --> 00:25:11.713
Oh, I got him.

00:25:11.713 --> 00:25:12.837
It's cool.

00:25:12.837 --> 00:25:13.801
Thanks.

00:25:15.377 --> 00:25:15.979
Watch your step.

00:25:15.979 --> 00:25:16.441
Thank you.

00:25:16.441 --> 00:25:16.963
Sure.

00:25:16.963 --> 00:25:17.736
Thank you.

00:25:23.367 --> 00:25:24.763
Let's go up these steps.

00:25:29.992 --> 00:25:31.197
Hey, can I talk to you for a second?

00:25:33.877 --> 00:25:34.941
You have the gun, man.

00:25:36.407 --> 00:25:37.099
Whatever.

00:25:43.243 --> 00:25:43.755
Stop!

00:25:43.755 --> 00:25:45.210
Come back here!

00:26:38.713 --> 00:26:39.335
Here.

00:26:42.206 --> 00:26:43.180
Take care of the guard.

00:26:43.822 --> 00:26:44.977
I'm going after the shifter.

00:27:01.158 --> 00:27:02.091
Sorry, ron.

00:27:02.975 --> 00:27:04.470
You did a real good
job tracking this thing.

00:27:04.470 --> 00:27:05.364
You really did.

00:27:37.636 --> 00:27:39.383
Oh, god, please don't hurt us.

00:27:39.383 --> 00:27:40.999
You shouldn't be back here right now!

00:27:40.999 --> 00:27:41.752
You're in danger!

00:27:41.752 --> 00:27:43.689
Now go back to the vault, now.

00:27:57.321 --> 00:27:59.358
Don't shoot! Don't shoot! Please!

00:27:59.780 --> 00:28:00.503
No, no, no, no!

00:28:00.503 --> 00:28:01.507
Back up!

00:28:01.828 --> 00:28:02.942
Don't even think about it!

00:28:03.343 --> 00:28:05.441
Please, don't shoot!

00:28:10.541 --> 00:28:11.996
I said get back now!

00:28:13.422 --> 00:28:14.807
One of the hostages seems to
have taken over the situation.

00:28:14.807 --> 00:28:16.202
Excuse me?

00:28:17.015 --> 00:28:18.651
Go, go, go.

00:28:27.475 --> 00:28:28.549
We are so screwed.

00:28:36.338 --> 00:28:37.121
Yeah?

00:28:37.121 --> 00:28:38.316
Slipped his skin.

00:28:38.316 --> 00:28:39.049
What?

00:28:39.049 --> 00:28:42.462
Yeah, bastard shifts fast, a lot
faster than the one in st.Louis.

00:28:42.462 --> 00:28:44.158
It's like playing a shell game.

00:28:44.158 --> 00:28:45.423
It could be anybody again.

00:28:45.694 --> 00:28:47.481
I think most of the
employees are in the vault.

00:28:47.481 --> 00:28:48.926
You search every inch of this place.

00:28:48.926 --> 00:28:50.382
I'm gonna go round everybody up.

00:29:06.021 --> 00:29:06.764
Crap.

00:29:06.764 --> 00:29:07.657
What?

00:29:07.657 --> 00:29:09.052
The feds are here.

00:29:10.096 --> 00:29:11.482
Oh, crap.

00:29:17.304 --> 00:29:18.308
Lieutenant robards.

00:29:19.080 --> 00:29:19.713
Yeah.

00:29:20.104 --> 00:29:21.560
Special agent hendrickson.

00:29:21.560 --> 00:29:22.684
Let me guess.

00:29:22.684 --> 00:29:26.057
You're lead dog now, but you would
just love my full cooperation.

00:29:26.057 --> 00:29:27.492
I don't give a rat's ass what you do.

00:29:27.492 --> 00:29:29.751
You can go get a doughnut and
bang your wife for all I care.

00:29:29.751 --> 00:29:32.441
What I do need is your
S.W.A.T.Team locked and loaded.

00:29:33.866 --> 00:29:37.320
Listen, agent, something's
not right about this.

00:29:38.123 --> 00:29:38.865
It's, uh...

00:29:40.130 --> 00:29:42.068
It's not going down like a usual heist.

00:29:42.068 --> 00:29:43.563
That's because it isn't one.

00:29:44.045 --> 00:29:46.314
You have no idea what
you're dealing with, do you?

00:29:46.976 --> 00:29:49.435
There is a monster
in that bank, robards.

00:30:15.073 --> 00:30:17.171
And I thought you were
one of the good guys.

00:30:19.078 --> 00:30:19.811
What's your name?

00:30:20.122 --> 00:30:21.166
Why would you care?

00:30:21.537 --> 00:30:22.330
My name's dean.

00:30:24.569 --> 00:30:25.171
I'm sheri.

00:30:26.365 --> 00:30:27.168
Hi, sheri.

00:30:31.364 --> 00:30:32.609
Everything's gonna be all right.

00:30:32.820 --> 00:30:34.426
This will all be over soon, okay?

00:30:47.144 --> 00:30:47.756
Yeah.

00:30:47.907 --> 00:30:49.664
This is special agent
victor hendrickson.

00:30:49.664 --> 00:30:52.053
I'm not really in a negotiating mood.

00:30:52.053 --> 00:30:53.187
Good.Me neither.

00:30:53.187 --> 00:30:55.998
It's my job to bring you in
-Alive's a bonus, but not necessary.

00:30:55.998 --> 00:30:58.316
That's harsh for a federal
agent, don't you think?

00:30:58.316 --> 00:31:00.344
Well, you're not the typical
suspect, are you, dean?

00:31:02.573 --> 00:31:05.895
I want you and sam out
here unarmed, or we come in.

00:31:05.895 --> 00:31:08.435
And, yes, I know about
sam -Bonnie to your clyde.

00:31:09.077 --> 00:31:11.717
Yeah, well, that part's true, but
how'd you even know we were here?

00:31:11.717 --> 00:31:12.581
Go screw yourself.

00:31:12.581 --> 00:31:13.635
That's how I knew.

00:31:13.635 --> 00:31:15.863
It's become my job to
know about you, dean.

00:31:15.863 --> 00:31:17.820
I've been looking for you for weeks now.

00:31:17.820 --> 00:31:21.304
I know about the murder in st.Louis,
the houdini act you pulled in baltimore.

00:31:21.304 --> 00:31:23.723
I know about the
desecrations and the thefts.

00:31:23.723 --> 00:31:25.018
I know about your dad.

00:31:25.018 --> 00:31:27.146
You don't know crap about my dad.

00:31:27.146 --> 00:31:33.440
Ex-Marine, raised his kids on the road, cheap motels,
backwood cabins -Real paramilitary survivalist type.

00:31:33.440 --> 00:31:38.850
I just can't get a handle on what type of wacko he
was -White supremist, timmy mcveigh, tomato, tomahto.

00:31:38.850 --> 00:31:41.289
You got no right talking
about my dad like that.

00:31:41.841 --> 00:31:42.986
He was a hero.

00:31:43.096 --> 00:31:44.220
Yeah, right.

00:31:44.220 --> 00:31:45.365
Sure sounds like it.

00:31:45.365 --> 00:31:49.189
You have one hour to make a decision, or
we come through those doors full automatic.

00:31:55.774 --> 00:31:56.467
Scramble your men.

00:31:56.467 --> 00:31:57.812
Five minutes, then we go in.

00:31:57.812 --> 00:31:58.695
What?

00:31:58.695 --> 00:32:01.345
Hendrickson, they've let
out one hostage so far.

00:32:01.345 --> 00:32:02.690
They've hurt no one
as far as we can tell.

00:32:02.690 --> 00:32:04.216
You don't know these winchesters.

00:32:04.216 --> 00:32:05.893
They're dangerous and expertly trained.

00:32:05.893 --> 00:32:07.870
We can't risk the lives
of all those people.

00:32:07.870 --> 00:32:09.817
Dean's a greater risk
to them than we are.

00:32:09.817 --> 00:32:10.651
This is crazy.

00:32:10.651 --> 00:32:13.441
Crazy's in there, and
I just hung up on it.

00:32:51.315 --> 00:32:52.459
Amn it.

00:32:56.223 --> 00:32:57.769
We got a bit of a problem outside.

00:32:59.285 --> 00:33:00.419
We got a problem in here.

00:33:04.083 --> 00:33:04.936
Sheri?

00:33:05.769 --> 00:33:06.643
We're gonna let you go.

00:33:07.165 --> 00:33:07.948
What?

00:33:09.012 --> 00:33:09.855
Why me?

00:33:10.116 --> 00:33:11.883
As a show of good faith
to the feds.Come on.

00:33:16.199 --> 00:33:18.979
I think I'd rather stay
here with the others.

00:33:19.963 --> 00:33:21.218
I'm afraid I'm gonna have to insist.

00:33:44.155 --> 00:33:45.249
I thought you were letting me go.

00:33:47.277 --> 00:33:49.104
Oh, god!

00:33:51.683 --> 00:33:54.103
Was that community theater, or
are you just naturally that good?

00:33:54.103 --> 00:33:56.572
This is the last time
you become anybody, ever.

00:33:57.094 --> 00:33:57.937
God

00:34:21.617 --> 00:34:22.771
Dean, wait, wait, wait.

00:34:24.749 --> 00:34:26.023
What's the advantage of this plan?

00:34:27.921 --> 00:34:29.898
I mean, fainting now
wouldn't help it survive.

00:34:36.985 --> 00:34:37.838
No!

00:35:10.502 --> 00:35:11.797
Get her out of here now!

00:36:10.981 --> 00:36:11.784
Don't shoot!

00:36:12.898 --> 00:36:13.912
Don't shoot!

00:36:14.715 --> 00:36:15.257
I work here.

00:36:15.659 --> 00:36:16.372
I work here.

00:37:20.033 --> 00:37:21.157
Gross.

00:38:18.083 --> 00:38:18.615
Move!

00:38:18.615 --> 00:38:19.147
Clear!

00:38:19.147 --> 00:38:20.020
Move!

00:38:21.205 --> 00:38:22.028
Clear.

00:38:22.409 --> 00:38:23.393
Move.

00:38:23.784 --> 00:38:24.487
Clear.

00:38:29.205 --> 00:38:31.795
Male, african-American, goner.

00:38:33.531 --> 00:38:36.984
